    "Brands you love, styles, colors, materials, sizes, your budget, what you're hunting for and why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marcas que amas, estilos, colores, materiales, tallas, tu presupuesto, qué buscas y por qué."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mga brand na mahal mo, estilo, kulay, materyales, size, budget mo, kung ano ang hinahanap mo at bakit."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes marques préférées, styles, couleurs, matières, tailles, ton budget, ce que tu cherches et pourquoi."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपके पसंदीदा ब्रांड, स्टाइल, रंग, मटीरियल, साइज़, बजट, आप क्या खोज रहे हैं और क्यों।"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merek favoritmu, gaya, warna, bahan, ukuran, budgetmu, apa yang kamu buru, dan alasannya."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好きなブランド、スタイル、色、素材、サイズ、予算、探しているものとその理由。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "좋아하는 브랜드, 스타일, 색상, 소재, 사이즈, 예산, 찾는 것과 그 이유까지."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "แบรนด์ที่คุณรัก สไตล์ สี วัสดุ ไซซ์ งบของคุณ สิ่งที่กำลังตามหา และเหตุผล"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thương hiệu bạn yêu thích, phong cách, màu sắc, chất liệu, kích cỡ, ngân sách, thứ bạn đang săn và lý do."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你喜爱的品牌、风格、颜色、材质、尺码、预算,以及你想找什么、为什么想找。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你愛的品牌、風格、顏色、材質、尺寸、預算，以及你想找什麼、為什麼想找。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bring your crew.\nSee who shares your taste.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "叫上你的小伙伴，\n看看谁和你品味相同。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invite ta bande.\nVois qui partage tes goûts."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rủ hội bạn vào nhé.\nXem ai cùng gu với bạn."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "친구들을 초대하세요.\n나와 취향이 같은 사람을 확인해 보세요."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "अपनी टोली को बुलाओ।\nदेखो किसका टेस्ट तुमसे मिलता है।"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ชวนเพื่อนมาด้วยกัน\nดูว่าใครมีเทสต์ใกล้กับคุณ"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trae a tu grupo.\nMira quién comparte tu gusto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帶上你的夥伴。\n看看誰和你品味相同。"
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isama ang barkada mo.\nAlamin kung sino ang kapareho mo ng taste."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仲間を呼ぼう。\nテイストが合う人を見つけよう。"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajak gengmu.\nLihat siapa yang seleranya sama."
          }
        }
      }
    },
