            "value": "お見せできるものはまだありません"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "아직 보여드릴 만한 게 없어요"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ยังไม่มีอะไรน่าโชว์"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chưa có gì đáng xem"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时没有值得推荐的"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有值得給你看的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing yet. Like or pass a few finds, or tell it what you love.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún nada. Dale me gusta o descarta algunos hallazgos, o cuéntale qué te encanta."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wala pa. Mag-like o mag-pass ng ilang nahanap, o sabihin kung ano ang love mo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien pour l'instant. Like ou ignore quelques trouvailles, ou dis-lui ce que tu aimes."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "अभी कुछ नहीं। कुछ खोजें लाइक या पास करें, या बताएँ कि आपको क्या पसंद है।"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belum ada. Sukai atau lewati beberapa temuan, atau ceritakan apa yang kamu suka."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだ何もありません。発見にいいねやパスをするか、好きなものを教えてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "아직 없어요. 발견에 좋아요를 누르거나 넘기거나, 좋아하는 걸 알려주세요."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ยังไม่มีอะไร กดถูกใจหรือข้ามของที่เจอสักหน่อย หรือบอกว่าคุณชอบอะไร"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chưa có gì. Hãy thích hoặc bỏ qua vài phát hiện, hoặc nói món bạn mê."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有内容。喜欢或略过几个发现,或告诉它你爱什么。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有內容。對幾個發現按喜歡或略過,或直接告訴它你愛什麼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing yet. Testers can shake their phone or use Settings → Send feedback.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún nada. Los testers pueden agitar su teléfono o usar Ajustes → Enviar comentarios."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wala pa. Puwedeng i-shake ng testers ang phone o gamitin ang Settings → Send feedback."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien pour l'instant. Les testeurs peuvent secouer leur téléphone ou aller dans Réglages → Envoyer un commentaire."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "अभी कुछ नहीं। टेस्टर फ़ोन हिलाएँ या सेटिंग्स → फ़ीडबैक भेजें में जाएँ।"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belum ada. Tester bisa mengguncang ponsel atau buka Pengaturan → Kirim masukan."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだ何もありません。テスターは端末を振るか、設定→フィードバックを送信をご利用ください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "아직 없어요. 테스터는 휴대폰을 흔들거나 설정 → 피드백 보내기를 이용해 주세요."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ยังไม่มีอะไร ผู้ทดสอบเขย่าโทรศัพท์ หรือใช้ การตั้งค่า → ส่งความคิดเห็น ได้"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chưa có gì. Người thử nghiệm có thể lắc điện thoại hoặc vào Cài đặt → Gửi phản hồi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时没有内容。测试人员可以摇一摇手机,或使用“设置”→“发送反馈”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有內容。測試人員可搖動手機,或使用「設定」→「傳送意見回饋」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing yet. When your squad finds something, it'll text you here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún nada. Cuando tu escuadrón encuentre algo, te escribirá aquí."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wala pa. Kapag may nahanap ang squad mo, ite-text ka rito."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien pour l'instant. Quand ta squad trouvera quelque chose, elle t'écrira ici."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "अभी कुछ नहीं। आपके स्क्वाड को कुछ मिलेगा तो यहाँ टेक्स्ट आएगा।"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belum ada. Kalau squad-mu menemukan sesuatu, kamu akan dapat pesan di sini."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだ何もありません。スクワッドが何か見つけると、ここにメッセージが届きます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "아직 없어요. 스카우트가 뭔가 찾으면 여기로 문자를 보내줄 거예요."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ยังไม่มีอะไร เมื่อแก๊งของคุณเจอของ จะส่งข้อความมาตรงนี้"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chưa có gì. Khi nhóm của bạn tìm được món gì, sẽ nhắn bạn ở đây."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂时没有内容。当你的小队有发现时,会在这里给你发消息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有內容。當你的小隊找到東西,會在這裡傳訊息給你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Noticed you're really into %@ lately. Hunting more of that now!": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notamos que últimamente te interesa mucho %@. ¡Ahora buscamos más de eso!"
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Napansin kong hilig na hilig mo ang %@ lately. Hahanap pa ako niyan ngayon!"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ai vu que tu kiffes %@ en ce moment. Je cherche d'autres pépites !"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "देखा कि आप आजकल %@ में बहुत रुचि ले रहे हैं। अब इसी की और खोज चल रही है!"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kelihatannya kamu lagi suka banget %@. Aku cari lebih banyak sekarang!"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近%@にハマってますね。今すぐもっと探します!"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "요즘 %@에 푹 빠지셨네요. 지금 더 찾아볼게요!"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "สังเกตว่าช่วงนี้คุณสนใจ%@มาก ตอนนี้กำลังล่าเพิ่มให้!"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thấy gần đây bạn rất mê %@. Giờ mình đang săn thêm đây!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现你最近很喜欢%@。正在为你找更多!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發現你最近很迷%@。正在多找一些!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
