    "Pick a few. You'll get a personal scout for each, hunting drops, restocks and deals.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige algunas. Tendrás un explorador personal para cada una, buscando lanzamientos, reposiciones y ofertas."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pumili ng ilan. May sarili kang scout para sa bawat isa, naghahanap ng drops, restocks at deals."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisis-en quelques-uns. Tu auras un éclaireur perso pour chacun, à l'affût des sorties, des retours en stock et des bons plans."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कुछ चुनें। हर एक के लिए आपको एक पर्सनल स्काउट मिलेगा, जो ड्रॉप, रीस्टॉक और डील ढूँढेगा।"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pilih beberapa. Kamu akan dapat scout pribadi untuk masing-masing, yang memburu drop, restock, dan promo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いくつか選んでください。それぞれにパーソナルスカウトがつき、ドロップ、再入荷、お得情報を探します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "몇 가지를 골라 주세요. 각각에 맞는 개인 스카우트가 발매, 재입고, 특가를 찾아드려요."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เลือกสักสองสามอย่าง คุณจะได้สเคาท์ส่วนตัวสำหรับแต่ละอย่าง คอยล่าดรอป ของเข้าใหม่ และดีลเด็ด ๆ"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chọn vài mục. Mỗi mục bạn sẽ có một scout riêng, săn hàng mới, hàng về lại và ưu đãi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选几个吧。每个都会有专属侦察员,帮你盯新品、补货和优惠。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選幾個吧。每個都會有專屬偵察員,幫你追蹤新品發售、補貨與優惠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a photo, or this scout keeps its auto emoji.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige una foto o este explorador mantendrá su emoji automático."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pumili ng photo, o mananatili ang auto emoji ng scout na ito."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisis une photo, sinon cet éclaireur garde son emoji automatique."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कोई फ़ोटो चुनें, वरना इस स्काउट का ऑटो इमोजी ही रहेगा।"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pilih foto, atau scout ini tetap memakai emoji otomatisnya."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写真を選ばない場合、このスカウトは自動の絵文字のままです。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "사진을 고르세요. 아니면 이 스카우트는 자동 이모지를 유지해요."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เลือกรูปภาพ ไม่อย่างนั้นสเคาท์นี้จะใช้อีโมจิอัตโนมัติ"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chọn ảnh, hoặc scout này sẽ giữ emoji tự động."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选一张照片,否则这个侦察员会保留自动表情符号。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請選擇照片,否則這位偵察員會沿用自動表情符號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
