    "Replace it any time: type something new into \"What are you hunting?\" and a fresh scout starts right away": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reemplázalo cuando quieras: escribe algo nuevo en \"¿Qué estás buscando?\" y un explorador nuevo empieza al instante"
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Palitan anumang oras: mag-type ng bago sa \"Ano ang hinahanap mo?\" at agad magsisimula ang bagong scout"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remplacez-le à tout moment : saisissez autre chose dans « Que cherchez-vous ? » et un nouvel éclaireur démarre aussitôt"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कभी भी बदलें: \"आप क्या ढूंढ रहे हैं?\" में कुछ नया लिखें और नया स्काउट तुरंत शुरू हो जाएगा"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ganti kapan saja: ketik hal baru di \"Apa yang kamu buru?\" dan scout baru langsung mulai bekerja"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いつでも入れ替えOK。「何を探していますか?」に新しく入力すると、すぐに新しいスカウトが動き出します"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "언제든 바꿀 수 있어요. \"무엇을 찾고 있나요?\"에 새로 입력하면 새 스카우트가 바로 시작돼요"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เปลี่ยนได้ทุกเมื่อ แค่พิมพ์สิ่งใหม่ในช่อง \"คุณกำลังตามหาอะไร?\" แล้วสเกาต์ตัวใหม่จะเริ่มทำงานทันที"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bạn có thể thay bất cứ lúc nào: nhập món mới vào \"What are you hunting?\" và một scout mới sẽ bắt đầu ngay"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随时可以替换:在“你在找什么?”中输入新内容,新的侦察员会立刻开始工作"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隨時都能替換:在「你在找什麼?」輸入新內容,新的獵手就會立刻開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
