    "When something great turns up, your scout texts you a photo and why it's worth a look.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando aparece algo genial, tu explorador te envía una foto y por qué vale la pena verlo."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kapag may nakitang magandang item, magti-text sa iyo ang scout mo ng photo at kung bakit sulit itong silipin."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand une pépite apparaît, ton éclaireur t'envoie une photo par SMS et te dit pourquoi elle vaut le coup d'œil."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "कुछ शानदार मिलते ही आपका स्काउट फ़ोटो और देखने लायक होने की वजह के साथ मैसेज करता है।"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saat ada yang bagus, scout-mu mengirim foto dan alasan kenapa layak dilirik."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いいものが見つかると、スカウトが写真と注目の理由をメッセージで送ります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "멋진 걸 발견하면 스카우트가 사진과 추천 이유를 문자로 보내 줘요."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เมื่อเจอของเด็ด สเกาต์จะส่งรูปและเหตุผลที่น่าดูให้ทางข้อความ"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Khi có món tuyệt vời xuất hiện, scout sẽ nhắn cho bạn kèm ảnh và lý do đáng xem."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遇到好东西时,侦察员会给你发照片,并告诉你值得一看的理由。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一有好東西,你的偵察員就會傳照片給你,並說明值得一看的原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who else hunts like you?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还有谁和你一样爱寻宝？"
